{
  "title": "PR 131 · Keep the consequence",
  "headings": [
    {
      "tag": "H1",
      "id": "",
      "text": "A parent must preserve\nthe prediction.",
      "y": 159
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "52 as delivered",
      "y": 453
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "52 corrected here",
      "y": 453
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The complete critique",
      "y": 1056
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Reverse the dependency; name the value route.",
      "y": 2299
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Four links are not four isolated parents.",
      "y": 3307
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Preserved by the section parent",
      "y": 3529
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Preserved across fronts; weak local attachment",
      "y": 3979
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The two-scope consequence survives",
      "y": 4456
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Placement survives; spell out the reason when isolating it",
      "y": 4932
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Exact numbers can deepen a rule.\nA new rule needs a parent.",
      "y": 5498
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "A child failure can spend a fresh-launch budget",
      "y": 5767
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "One shutdown family contains different wait boundaries",
      "y": 6345
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Memory limits do not identify the two sampling jobs",
      "y": 6973
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Diagnostic history and pending writes consume different capacity",
      "y": 7551
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The helper can make the directory before capture exists",
      "y": 8156
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "A positive floor is conditional, and helper precedence differs",
      "y": 8734
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Use 52 as a comparison frame,\nnot a completeness certificate.",
      "y": 9423
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The same questions still reach\nthe same explanations.",
      "y": 15297
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Failed fetch, limit two",
      "y": 15539
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Same identify, different caller",
      "y": 15801
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Zero inline, empty directory",
      "y": 16062
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "First close, then a different completion error",
      "y": 16351
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The pair is usable.\nThe unfamiliar-reader comparison remains unrun.",
      "y": 16863
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The prepared validation comparison in 49",
      "y": 17505
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "What this run checked.",
      "y": 17965
    }
  ],
